Description:
This somewhat primitive command allows you to block users you don't want to 
see posts from.

Note
The match is "case-insensitive" but must otherwise be exact.

This means that "Kalle Johansson" and "kALle joHanSSoN" will match, but
"Johanna" and "anna" will not.

In the current version, arguments are not supported, but instead SklaffKOM's
regular editor is opened. In it, you edit your list of unwanted users.

A tip might be to "Skip subject" after a blocked text, so you also avoid any
quotes in subsequent comments.

Everything for a more pleasant reading experience!
